        "synopsis": {
            "value": "Cheon Yeo-Ri (Park Eun-Bin) is a chaebol heiress and hotel owner. She appears flawless on the outside, but, behind that, she holds an eerie secret. Her secret is that she sees ghosts.\n\nMa Gang-Uk (Yang Se-Jong) is an ace prosecutor with excellent physique, brilliant mind and righteous personality. He always obeys his principles and never backs down in the face of injustice. Cheon Yeo-Ri and Ma Gang-Uk form a unique and unexpected relationship through a strange encounter that follows accidentally and inevitably. They cooperate to solve cases by using their respective abilities. Their relationship also develops.",
